DESCRIPTION:The Primaries are over! Join us as we take time to enjoy a fun
  afternoon together. The LCDC Women's Caucus is hosting a screening of "Le
 gally Blonde" at Zoetropolis on Sunday\, May 31 from 3:15-5:45. Tickets an
 d popcorn are free. Drinks will be available for purchase. After the movie
 \, we will have time for conversation. Please bring a donation of period p
 roducts to support others in our community\, if you are able. Tickets will
  be given on a first-come\, first-served basis.
LOCATION:Zoetropolis Cinema Stillhouse\, 112 N Water St\, Lancaster\, PA\,
  17603
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/lancastercountydems/event/958609/
X-SOURCE:Lancaster County Dems (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
